        "headline": "瑞航LX16因客艙煙霧改降班戈 208名乘客及機組員平安",
        "summary": "瑞士國際航空LX16於美東時間7月27日12時14分左右，因商務艙出現來源不明煙霧，改降美國緬因州班戈國際機場。航機安全落地，消防檢查未發現火源或異常熱度；SWISS表示208名乘客及機組員均平安。FAA初步資料則記載機組員通報駕駛艙起火，兩種說法仍待調查釐清。",
        "headline_en": "SWISS LX16 Diverts to Bangor After Smoke; Passengers and Crew Safe",
        "summary_en": "SWISS flight LX16 diverted to Bangor International Airport at about 12:14 p.m. EDT on July 27 after smoke was reported in the business-class cabin. The Airbus A330 landed safely, and firefighters found no signs of fire or heat. SWISS said all 208 passengers and crew were safe. The FAA’s preliminary statement separately said the crew had reported a cockpit fire, a description that remains subject to change and differs from the airline’s account.",
